---------------------------

In this folder index.html page is available

ATTENTION: Edit the index.html and update the URL
--------

Create a S3 public bucket and upload index.html and enable static website hosting

Open Application and start adding employees


See the data in DynamoDB


See the SQS Queues, you dont find any messages because employee-consumer is automatically consuming the message

If you want to see, remove the trigger in employee-consumer lambda function

And add the new entries from application, that will go to SQS , as there are no consumers all messages are there in the Queues

Now enable again the trigger, automatically what ever is there in the SQS messages will be consumed by lambda and stored in Dynamodb


